# 1️⃣8️⃣ Boats & Streams

Two important speeds:

### Boat speed in still water

[
B
]

### Stream speed

[
S
]

---

# 1️⃣9️⃣ Downstream

Boat moves **with the stream**.

[
\boxed{Downstream=B+S}
]

---

# 2️⃣0️⃣ Upstream

Boat moves **against the stream**.

[
\boxed{Upstream=B-S}
]

---

# 🔥 2️⃣1️⃣ Finding Boat & Stream Speed

If:

[
Downstream=D
]

and:

[
Upstream=U
]

Then:

[
\boxed{
Boat=\frac{D+U}{2}
}
]

[
\boxed{
Stream=\frac{D-U}{2}
}
]

---

